{"model": "small.en", "slug": "C_S03E04", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.76, "text": "-Didn't they say 304? -No, 303. I wrote it down twice."}, {"start": 3.76, "end": 10.6, "text": "-Troy and Abbot's new apartment! -Hi!"}, {"start": 10.6, "end": 16.1, "text": "-Come on in, come on in. -Wow, what a great place."}, {"start": 16.1, "end": 22.6, "text": "-You guys look so fancy. -Thanks. We read a book on how to be the perfect party host. Rule number one, dressed to impress."}, {"start": 22.6, "end": 27.9, "text": "-Rule number two, avoid touchy topics like the Negro problem. The book was written in the '40s."}, {"start": 27.9, "end": 29.9, "text": "Oh, good. You guys are finally here."}, {"start": 29.9, "end": 30.9, "text": "Finally?"}, {"start": 30.9, "end": 32.4, "text": "Shirley showed up at three."}, {"start": 32.4, "end": 33.9, "text": "Time flies when I'm baking."}, {"start": 33.9, "end": 34.9, "text": "No, it doesn't."}, {"start": 34.9, "end": 37.9, "text": "Oh, the door downstairs was propped open with this."}, {"start": 37.9, "end": 38.9, "text": "This is really unsafe."}, {"start": 38.9, "end": 40.9, "text": "Anyone could have just wandered into your building."}, {"start": 41.9, "end": 42.9, "text": "Like one of our guests?"}, {"start": 42.9, "end": 43.9, "text": "I'll be right back."}, {"start": 43.9, "end": 44.9, "text": "Thank you, Troy."}, {"start": 44.9, "end": 45.9, "text": "Let me give you ladies the grand tour."}, {"start": 45.9, "end": 46.9, "text": "Bathroom, kitchen, who cares?"}, {"start": 46.9, "end": 49.9, "text": "And this is my scale model of the rolling boulder scene from Raiders"}, {"start": 49.9, "end": 51.9, "text": "with actual rolling boulder."}, {"start": 51.9, "end": 52.9, "text": "Ooh."}, {"start": 52.9, "end": 54.9, "text": "Adios, beautiful."}, {"start": 54.9, "end": 56.9, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 56.9, "end": 57.9, "text": "Pretty cool, huh?"}, {"start": 57.9, "end": 58.9, "text": "Super cool."}, {"start": 