- Yeah, sorry."}, {"start": 120.04, "end": 122.34, "text": "I've got an invite to the opening of a new club."}, {"start": 122.34, "end": 124.62, "text": "Look at this place, it's like it was designed for me."}, {"start": 124.62, "end": 125.88, "text": "- It was."}, {"start": 125.88, "end": 126.88, "text": "I made that in Photoshop and made it to you a month ago"}, {"start": 126.88, "end": 128.88, "text": "so that you'd keep tonight open on your calendar."}, {"start": 128.88, "end": 130.68, "text": "- There's no such thing as single malt platinum"}, {"start": 130.68, "end": 132.72, "text": "boobs and billiards club?"}, {"start": 132.72, "end": 134.22, "text": "(sighs)"}, {"start": 134.22, "end": 135.92, "text": "I guess I never said it out loud."}, {"start": 135.92, "end": 137.42, "text": "- Tonight, we offer something far more"}, {"start": 137.42, "end": 138.72, "text": "than boobs and billiards. - What?"}, {"start": 138.72, "end": 140.96, "text": "- One word, two syllables."}, {"start": 140.96, "end": 142.76, "text": "Don't say charades."}, {"start": 142.76, "end": 144.96, "text": "Yahtzee!"}, {"start": 144.96, "end": 147.14, "text": "Is charades off the table?"}, {"start": 147.14, "end": 148.84, "text": "♪ Give me some more ♪"}, {"start": 148.84, "end": 150.64, "text": "♪ Time and dream ♪"}, {"start": 150.64, "end": 152.14, "text": "♪ Give me the hope ♪"}, {"start": 152.14, "end": 153.84, "text": "♪ To run on the steam ♪"}, {"start": 153.84, "end": 155.64, "text": "♪ Somebody say ♪"}, {"start": 155.64, "end": 157.24, "text": "♪ We could be here ♪"}, {"start": 157.24, "end": 158.64, "text": "♪ We could be both ♪"}, {"start": 158.64, "end": 161.22, "text": "♪ So tired of bedding again ♪"}, {"start": 161.22, "end": 166.18, "text": "♪ I can't count the reasons I should stay ♪"}, {"start": 166.18, "end": 170.34, "text": "♪ Walk by one, the arches, baby ♪"}, {"start": 175.68, "end": 176.52, "text": "- And..."}, {"start": 177.52, "end": 178.36, "text": "- Okay."}, {"start": 180.1, "end": 182.1, "text": "Now, how to play Yahtzee."}, {"start": 184.1, "end": 185.56, "text": "- Is there nothing from our youth"}, {"start": 185.56, "end": 188.44, "text": "that these companies won't repackage for a buck?"}, {"start": 188.44, "end": 190.14, "text": "Call a Yahtzee all you want."}, {"start": 190.14, "end": 192.4, "text": "Everybody knows it's Puerto Rican chess."}, {"start": 192.4, "end": 193.4, "text": "(buzzer)"}, {"start": 193.4, "end": 194.4, "text": "(gasps)"}, {"start": 194.4, "end": 195.64, "text": "- Annie, it's just the pizza."}, {"start": 195.64, "end": 197.96, "text": "We can't buzz 'em up, someone has to go down."}, {"start": 200.48, "end": 201.64, "text": "- Ah, okay."}, {"start": 201.64, "end": 204.92, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 204.92, "end": 206.16, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating"}, {"start": 206.16, "end": 207.08, "text": "six different timelines."}, {"start": 207.08, "end": 208.5, "text": "- Of course I am, Obed."}, {"start": 213.18, "end": 215.0, "text": "Two, one, two, Annie."}, {"start": 215.0, "end": 216.08, "text": "- Okay, fine."}, {"start": 216.08, "end": 217.28, "text": "I guess I'm going down."}, {"start": 217.28, "end": 219.08, "text": "- All this talk of going down."}, {"start": 219.08, "end": 220.92, "text": "Did you guys know I had sex with Eartha Kitt"}, {"start": 220.92, "end": 222.2, "text": "in an airplane bathroom?"}, {"start": 222.2, "end": 223.04, "text": "- Oh! - Oh!"}, {"start": 223.04, "end": 224.56, "text": "- We're about to eat."}, {"start": 224.56, "end": 226.48, "text": "Name-dropping comes up organically."}, {"start": 226.48, "end": 227.82, "text": "- I'm gonna check it on my pies."}, {"start": 227.82, "end": 228.66, "text": "- Fast!"}, {"start": 228.66, "end": 229.5, "text": "- No!"}, {"start": 230.8, "end": 231.72, "text": "- Bathroom?"}, {"start": 231.72, "end": 232.66, "text": "- Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 234.22, "end": 235.52, "text": "- Uh, guys?"}, {"start": 236.42, "end": 237.92, "text": "What does a pregnancy test look like?"}, {"start": 237.92, "end": 239.3, "text": "- Oh, it's like a thin piece of plastic"}, {"start": 239.3, "end": 240.34, "text": "with a thing on the end of it."}, {"start": 240.34, "end": 242.16, "text": "- Okay, so this is definitely a gun."}, {"start": 242.16, "end": 244.46, "text": "- Whoa, yeah, put that away."}, {"start": 244.46, "end": 245.94, "text": "- Why does Annie have a gun?"}, {"start": 245.94, "end": 248.2, "text": "- That's not a gun, that's a girl's pea-shooter."}, {"start": 248.2, "end": 250.72, "text": "Here, Troy, happy housewarming."}, {"start": 251.68, "end": 253.34, "text": "- Jeff, what are we gonna do about this?"}, {"start": 253.34, "end": 255.04, "text": "I'm going to get a drink."}, {"start": 255.04, "end": 256.84, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 256.84, "end": 257.72, "text": "What's so funny?"}, {"start": 257.72, "end": 258.44, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 258.44, "end": 259.84, "text": "People are getting their heads up."}, {"start": 259.84, "end": 260.72, "text": "Don't bite over them."}, {"start": 263.72, "end": 266.4, "text": "Well, you can fight a little."}, {"start": 266.4, "end": 267.8, "text": "Smells weird."}, {"start": 267.8, "end": 269.2, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}, {"start": 269.2, "end": 269.76, "text": "Smells weird."}, {"start": 269.76, "end": 270.4, "text": "What did you do?"}, {"start": 270.4, "end": 273.16, "text": "Abed, you don't ask someone a question like that."}, {"start": 273.16, "end": 275.48, "text": "It's not dignified."}, {"start": 275.48, "end": 276.74, "text": "Pizza!"}, {"start": 276.74, "end": 281.16, "text": "Pizza, pizza, go with Tommy, me so hungry, me so hungry."}, {"start": 281.16, "end": 283.12, "text": "Pizza guy was super creepy."}, {"start": 283.12, "end": 285.12, "text": "- So you're saying he was a pizza guy."}, {"start": 287.5, "end": 289.2, "text": "- I wonder what happened in those other timelines."}, {"start": 289.2, "end": 292.2, "text": "- I'll bet there are no other timelines."}, {"start": 292.2, "end": 294.96, "text": "(buzzer buzzing)"}, {"start": 294.96, "end": 297.6, "text": "Okay, starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 297.6, "end": 299.0, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 299.0, "end": 300.2, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff, you are not creating"}, {"start": 300.2, "end": 301.12, "text": "six different timelines."}, {"start": 301.12, "end": 302.54, "text": "- Of course I am, I'll bet."}, {"start": 307.28, "end": 309.48, "text": "Four, one, two, three, four, Shirley."}, {"start": 309.48, "end": 311.64, "text": "- Okay, just don't let my pies burn."}, {"start": 313.12, "end": 315.12, "text": "Remember, no one eats those pies."}, {"start": 315.12, "end": 317.12, "text": "Come on, let's just talk to her."}, {"start": 317.12, "end": 319.12, "text": "We tried that, Annie, but she ignored us."}, {"start": 319.12, "end": 321.12, "text": "The woman has a baking problem."}, {"start": 321.12, "end": 324.12, "text": "Now, I don't like being the bad guy any more than anybody else."}, {"start": 324.12, "end": 326.12, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 326.12, "end": 328.12, "text": "Bathroom?"}, {"start": 328.12, "end": 330.12, "text": "Over here."}, {"start": 330.12, "end": 333.12, "text": "We have a pact. We do not enable her baking."}, {"start": 333.12, "end": 335.12, "text": "It's gonna be better for her in the long run."}, {"start": 335.12, "end": 337.12, "text": "You know who got it in the long run."}, {"start": 337.12, "end": 340.12, "text": "There's a kid when I nailed her in the airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 340.12, "end": 342.08, "text": "- I want to play in the bathroom. - Cheers."}, {"start": 342.16, "end": 344.12, "text": "- What? - Came up organically."}, {"start": 344.2, "end": 346.68, "text": "Here, Troy. Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 346.76, "end": 349.76, "text": "Oh. Cool."}, {"start": 349.84, "end": 351.92, "text": "Thanks, Piers."}, {"start": 352.0, "end": 354.16, "text": "Whoa! What is it?"}, {"start": 354.24, "end": 357.2, "text": "Look, it's a traditional Norwegian troll."}, {"start": 357.28, "end": 360.2, "text": "When Troy and I were living together, I had it on display in the hall."}, {"start": 360.28, "end": 362.4, "text": "You know, outside his bedroom."}, {"start": 362.48, "end": 365.4, "text": "He seemed very taken with it."}, {"start": 365.48, "end": 368.48, "text": "- He used to watch me sleep. - Piers, shame on you."}, {"start": 368.56, "end": 372.0, "text": "- Jeff, what are you going to do about this? - I'm going to get a drink."}, {"start": 372.08, "end": 374.88, "text": "- Oh, my God! Are you okay? - I barely felt it."}, {"start": 374.96, "end": 378.56, "text": "Well, let me look at it in the bathroom. It's not dignified."}, {"start": 378.64, "end": 382.08, "text": "Pizza! Pizza! Pizza in my tummy!"}, {"start": 382.16, "end": 386.8, "text": "- Me so hungry! Me so hungry! - Did someone remember to take out my pipe?"}, {"start": 388.24, "end": 389.56, "text": "Seriously?"}, {"start": 389.64, "end": 391.64, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 391.72, "end": 394.44, "text": "Oh! Oh, no!"}, {"start": 396.56, "end": 397.72, "text": "Seriously?"}, {"start": 397.72, "end": 399.44, "text": "- Shirley, it doesn't matter."}, {"start": 399.44, "end": 400.86, "text": "We weren't gonna eat them."}, {"start": 400.86, "end": 403.48, "text": "You're not allowed to have baking things as an identity."}, {"start": 403.48, "end": 405.84, "text": "- Excuse me for being the only married woman"}, {"start": 405.84, "end": 407.72, "text": "in a group full of horny toads"}, {"start": 407.72, "end": 409.64, "text": "who sit around all night just making googly eyes"}, {"start": 409.64, "end": 410.48, "text": "at each other."}, {"start": 410.48, "end": 411.64, "text": "- Googly eyes?"}, {"start": 415.44, "end": 416.28, "text": "Go!"}, {"start": 417.4, "end": 418.24, "text": 