: "- Ah, shit! - No."}, {"start": 477.84, "end": 479.84, "text": "- Bathroom? - Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 479.84, "end": 481.84, "text": "I love your place."}, {"start": 481.84, "end": 484.24, "text": "- Bathroom? - Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 484.32, "end": 488.24, "text": "I love your place, Troy. You're all grown up now."}, {"start": 488.32, "end": 491.76, "text": "I can't believe there's a real mahogany bunk beds in there."}, {"start": 491.84, "end": 494.4, "text": "I bet that cost you a few allowances."}, {"start": 496.48, "end": 498.52, "text": "- Oh, Troy! - Now we've done it."}, {"start": 499.48, "end": 501.76, "text": "- Britt is in the ba-- - Adios, Sipito."}, {"start": 506.24, "end": 507.92, "text": "- Who is it? - Troy."}, {"start": 508.0, "end": 509.92, "text": "I'm washing my hands."}, {"start": 510.0, "end": 512.42, "text": "- Good, then I can come in."}, {"start": 512.42, "end": 513.24, "text": "- Oh, hi."}, {"start": 515.42, "end": 517.5, "text": "I was smoking a cigarette."}, {"start": 517.5, "end": 519.08, "text": "- I know what you were doing."}, {"start": 519.08, "end": 520.72, "text": "I'm 21 years old."}, {"start": 520.72, "end": 521.56, "text": "I'm a man."}, {"start": 528.56, "end": 530.44, "text": "- I know that."}, {"start": 530.44, "end": 531.44, "text": "We all know that."}, {"start": 531.44, "end": 534.56, "text": "- Then why is Jeff always picking on me?"}, {"start": 534.56, "end": 536.7, "text": "- You seem to be a little hard on Troy lately."}, {"start": 536.7, "end": 538.7, "text": "- I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 538.7, "end": 540.44, "text": "- Oh my God, are you okay?"}, {"start": 540.44, "end": 541.28, "text": "- Barely felt it."}, {"start": 541.28, "end": 542.36, "text": "- Well, let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 542.36, "end": 543.64, "text": "- Britt is in the bathroom."}, {"start": 543.64, "end": 544.62, "text": "- Oh, um."}, {"start": 548.06, "end": 549.44, "text": "- Oh no, what happened?"}, {"start": 549.44, "end": 550.52, "text": "- A minor head wound."}, {"start": 550.52, "end": 551.36, "text": "If there's an abrasion,"}, {"start": 551.36, "end": 553.04, "text": "we'll clean it with iodine and apply ice."}, {"start": 553.04, "end": 554.4, "text": "- You make a good nurse."}, {"start": 554.4, "end": 555.24, "text": "- Thanks."}, {"start": 555.24, "end": 557.32, "text": "- Dr. Shirley says mini pies are the best medicine."}, {"start": 557.32, "end": 558.92, "text": "- Then I'd like to see her degree."}, {"start": 560.0, "end": 561.32, "text": "- He's butting antlers with you"}, {"start": 561.32, "end": 562.64, "text": "because you're a threat now."}, {"start": 562.64, "end": 565.28, "text": "You've got your own place, you've got a future,"}, {"start": 565.28, "end": 569.0, "text": "you've got a bowl full of olives next to the toilet?"}, {"start": 569.0, "end": 570.96, "text": "- It's a fancy party, Britta."}, {"start": 570.96, "end": 573.56, "text": "- You know what Jeff has in his bathroom?"}, {"start": 573.56, "end": 574.6, "text": "Neither do I."}, {"start": 574.6, "end": 578.52, "text": "He keeps his toiletries in a safe under the sink."}, {"start": 578.52, "end": 581.84, "text": "His whole personality is based around guarding himself."}, {"start": 581.84, "end": 584.0, "text": "You don't have to be like that to be a man."}, {"start": 586.64, "end": 588.04, "text": "- You're really cool, Britta."}, {"start": 589.16, "end": 592.12, "text": "- Man, pizza guys are getting worse and worse looking."}, {"start": 592.12, "end": 594.46, "text": "- Guess all the good ones went into porn."}, {"start": 594.46, "end": 595.46, "text": "Ceiling fan."}, {"start": 595.46, "end": 596.46, "text": "I miss all the fun."}, {"start": 596.46, "end": 598.46, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 598.46, "end": 599.46, "text": "Who cares?"}, {"start": 599.46, "end": 600.46, "text": "Who cares?"}, {"start": 606.46, "end": 607.46, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 607.46, "end": 610.46, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 610.46, "end": 612.46, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 612.46, "end": 614.46, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 618.46, "end": 621.46, "text": "Six. One, two, three, four, five, six, Britta."}, {"start": 621.46, "end": 622.46, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 622.46, "end": 623.46, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 623.46, "end": 625.9, "text": "You know, it's great. Air travel."}, {"start": 625.9, "end": 628.74, "text": "I've flown a lot, a lot of airplane stories."}, {"start": 628.74, "end": 630.24, "text": "I once had sex with Eartha Kidd."}, {"start": 630.24, "end": 632.28, "text": "Okay, I'm going to tickle my pies."}, {"start": 638.88, "end": 640.32, "text": "- You guys are my biz. - Biz?"}, {"start": 640.32, "end": 641.62, "text": "I'm not going to get a drink."}, {"start": 641.62, "end": 643.68, "text": "- Ow! - Oh, my goodness."}, {"start": 643.68, "end": 645.46, "text": "- Are you okay? - Barely felt it."}, {"start": 645.46, "end": 647.26, "text": "Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 649.22, "end": 651.4, "text": "- Did that mean to refill the toilet dollars? - We're good."}, {"start": 651.4, "end": 652.7, "text": "- I checked. - You're the best."}, {"start": 652.7, "end": 654.14, "text": "Want to stay up all night talking to her bunk beds?"}, {"start": 654.14, "end": 655.58, "text": "Do do."}, {"start": 655.58, "end": 656.86, "text": "Here, Troy."}, {"start": 656.86, "end": 658.26, "text": "Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 658.26, "end": 659.78, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 659.78, "end": 661.94, "text": "Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 661.94, "end": 663.56, "text": "You make a good nurse, Annie."}, {"start": 663.56, "end": 665.1, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 665.1, "end": 667.94, "text": "I actually had to apply a tourniquet the other day."}, {"start": 667.94, "end": 669.82, "text": "Like, I got stabbed outside my building."}, {"start": 669.82, "end": 670.72, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 670.72, "end": 672.98, "text": "Annie, you got to get the hell out of that apartment."}, {"start": 672.98, "end": 675.58, "text": "You don't have to treat me like a kid anymore, remember?"}, {"start": 675.58, "end": 678.9, "text": "Yeah, but adults still need to be protected."}, {"start": 678.9, "end": 682.22, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 682.22, "end": 683.62, "text": "- You're important to me."}, {"start": 686.92, "end": 687.76, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 687.76, "end": 688.9, "text": "- See you next time!"}, {"start": 688.9, "end": 690.3, "text": "- Stop the terror, Troy!"}, {"start": 690.3, "end": 692.86, "text": "- See you next time, Norwegian Troy!"}, {"start": 692.86, "end": 694.8, "text": "- What's going on in here?"}, {"start": 694.8, "end": 696.4, "text": "- Here's to terrorizing Troy because he's jealous"}, {"start": 696.4, "end": 697.24, "text": "we moved in together."}, {"start": 697.24, "end": 698.3, "text": "- You're the one who's jealous."}, {"start": 698.3, "end": 699.24, "text": "- Why would I be jealous?"}, {"start": 699.24, "end": 701.44, "text": "- Because you're lonely and crazy!"}, {"start": 707.14, "end": 710.44, "text": "- Hey guys, this is Toby, our pizza delivery guy,"}, {"start": 710.44, "end": 712.34, "text": "and I know this is gonna sound nuts,"}, {"start": 712.34, "end": 715.04, "text": "but we're in love and we're getting married."}, {"start": 722.42, "end": 724.32, "text": "- I wonder what happened to all those other timelines."}, {"start": 724.32, "end": 727.7, "text": "- Wait, there are other timelines?"}, {"start": 727.7, "end": 729.86, "text": "(buzzer buzzes)"}, {"start": 729.86, "end": 732.5, "text": "- Okay, starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 732.5, "end": 733.9, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 733.9, "end": 735.1, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating"}, {"start": 735.1, "end": 736.04, "text": "six different timelines."}, {"start": 736.04, "end": 738.0, "text": "- Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 738.0, "end": 740.76, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 742.02, "end": 743.48, "text": "- One, Troy."}, {"start": 743.48, "end": 745.26, "text": "- Damn it, I'm gonna go as fast as I can"}, {"start": 745.26, "end": 746.62, "text": "so I don't miss anything."}, {"start": 746.62, "end": 749.2, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 750.54, "end": 752.46, "text": "- You know who I used to call miss anything?"}, {"start": 752.46, "end": 753.3, "text": "Earth a kid."}, {"start": 754.8, "end": 756.42, "text": "Totally set it up."}, {"start": 756.42, "end": 757.92, "text": "- I'm checking on my pies."}, {"start": 759.46, "end": 760.3, "text": "- No."}, {"start": 761.18, "end": 762.14, "text": "- Bathroom?"}, {"start": 762.14, "end": 763.04, "text": "- Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 764.18, "end": 765.78, "text": "Jeff, tell us about your father."}, {"start": 765.78, "end": 767.58, "text": "- I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 767.58, "end": 770.16, "text": "- Oh my God, are you okay? - I really felt it."}, {"start": 770.24, "end": 771.5, "text": "Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 773.46, "end": 774.62, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 778.04, "end": 780.04, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 780.12, "end": 781.38, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 781.46, "end": 784.22, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 784.3, "end": 785.8, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 785.88, "end": 787.04, "text": "Call number one!"}, {"start": 787.14, "end": 789.22, "text": "Armin, help me stop the bleeding!"}, {"start": 789.3, "end": 791.18, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 791.98, "end": 793.06, "text": "I'm dying!"}, {"start": 793.64, "end": 795.06, "text": "I am dying!"}, {"start": 795.64, "end": 796.64, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 797.44, "end": 799.44, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 799.44, "end": 801.44, "text": "Water!"}, {"start": 801.44, "end": 803.44, "text": "Water!"}, {"start": 803.44, "end": 805.44, "text": "[cheering]"}, {"start": 819.44, "end": 821.44, "text": "[buzzer]"}, {"start": 821.44, "end": 825.44, "text": "Ah, okay. Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 825.44, "end": 827.58, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 827.58, "end": 829.08, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 836.08, "end": 838.38, "text": "Five. One, two, three, four, five."}, {"start": 838.38, "end": 839.38, "text": "- Abed. - I'm on it."}, {"start": 839.38, "end": 842.72, "text": "You know who else was on it? And do you know what it is?"}, {"start": 842.72, "end": 844.5, "text": "Everybody give me money."}, {"start": 844.5, "end": 848.8, "text": "Oh, that mascot really softens your personality."}, {"start": 848.8, "end": 851.7, "text": "I banged her at the kid."}, {"start": 851.7, "end": 854.6, "text": "- Fast! - No."}, {"start": 854.6, "end": 856.7, "text": "- Bathroom? - Down the hall."}, {"start": 860.2, "end": 862.7, "text": "- I'm being drinking. - Ow!"}, {"start": 862.7, "end": 865.2, "text": "- Oh, my God, are you okay? - I barely felt it."}, {"start": 865.2, "end": 867.2, "text": "- Let me look at it in the bathroom. - Where is it in the bathroom?"}, {"start": 867.2, "end": 869.2, "text": "Oh. Um..."}, {"start": 871.7, "end": 874.7, "text": "- Oh, no, what happened? - Minor head wound."}, {"start": 876.2, "end": 878.7, "text": "Oh, my God. What smells amazing?"}, {"start": 878.7, "end": 881.2, "text": "Oh, someone wants pie!"}, {"start": 881.2, "end": 884.2, "text": "- You look like a good nurse. - [giggling]"}, {"start": 884.6, "end": 889.6, "text": "Oh my God, they taste just like regular sized pies."}, {"start": 890.6, "end": 891.6, "text": "Oh yay!"}, {"start": 891.6, "end": 892.6, "text": "Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 892.6, "end": 895.6, "text": "Oh cool, thanks Pierce."}, {"start": 896.6, "end": 899.6, "text": "Hey while we're alone, I just want to say thanks for letting me live with you."}, {"start": 899.6, "end": 903.6, "text": "Sometimes I feel like making desserts is the only thing I'm good for in the group."}, {"start": 903.6, "end": 908.6, "text": "But now it's time for me to try and make it on my own, just like you did."}, {"start": 908.6, "end": 910.6, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 910.6, "end": 911.6, "text": "Yeah, I don't think you should open it."}, {"start": 911.6, "end": 913.6, "text": "No, what? What are you talking about?"}, {"start": 913.6, "end": 915.8, "text": "They're very important to me."}, {"start": 915.8, "end": 918.1, "text": "Crap. I was not supposed to eat your stuff."}, {"start": 918.1, "end": 920.1, "text": "We all made an agreement. Crap!"}, {"start": 920.1, "end": 922.1, "text": "I was not supposed to say that out loud. Crap!"}, {"start": 922.1, "end": 924.6, "text": "Okay, cards on the table. I'm really high right now."}, {"start": 924.6, "end": 926.6, "text": "♪ Hallelujah ♪"}, {"start": 926.6, "end": 929.1, "text": "Seriously, I want to give you something else."}, {"start": 929.1, "end": 932.1, "text": "A water pick, a speed boat, two water picks."}, {"start": 932.1, "end": 935.1, "text": "I can't believe I'm feeding my pies to a drug addict."}, {"start": 935.1, "end": 937.6, "text": "Drug addict? You're a pie pusher."}, {"start": 937.6, "end": 940.1, "text": "You push pies to get love."}, {"start": 940.1, "end": 944.02, "text": "Give it, Pierce! It feels fun!"}, {"start": 944.02, "end": 947.86, "text": "I'm sorry. I just had a weird deja vu."}, {"start": 947.86, "end": 949.44, "text": "You're bad at gift-giving!"}, {"start": 949.44, "end": 951.94, "text": "That thing you said about worrying about me?"}, {"start": 951.94, "end": 953.7, "text": "Something my dad always said."}, {"start": 953.7, "end": 955.7, "text": "I demand to be house-worn!"}, {"start": 955.7, "end": 957.7, "text": "I shouldn't have brought it up."}, {"start": 957.7, "end": 959.94, "text": "Just reminded me of my dad."}, {"start": 959.94, "end": 961.24, "text": "Anyway..."}, {"start": 961.24, "end": 963.78, "text": "Uh, little make-out 101, less dad talk,"}, {"start": 963.78, "end": 966.62, "text": "and, uh, you could ease up on the bubblegum lip gloss."}, {"start": 966.62, "end": 967.96, "text": "-Okay. -No, I really..."}, {"start": 967.96, "end": 968.8, "text": "- No, you!"}, {"start": 973.0, "end": 973.84, "text": "- Pizza time!"}, {"start": 973.84, "end": 976.38, "text": "- Give me this, you godless hippie skank!"}, {"start": 976.38, "end": 978.88, "text": "- You're a sick, sad, twisted old man"}, {"start": 978.88, "end": 980.84, "text": "and I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 980.84, "end": 981.68, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 984.68, "end": 988.52, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 991.82, "end": 992.9, "text": "I gotta say, I hope this is the real one"}, {"start": 992.9, "end": 995.9, "text": "because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 995.9, "end": 1004.62, "text": "Ah, okay. Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1004.62, "end": 1006.78, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 1006.78, "end": 1008.74, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 1008.74, "end": 1014.98, "text": "I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1014.98, "end": 1018.38, "text": "K.S. already dominates enough of our lives."}, {"start": 1018.38, "end": 1021.1, "text": "The universe is an endless, raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1021.1, "end": 1022.94, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it, but to weather it together."}, {"start": 1022.94, "end": 1028.98, "text": "On the raft of life a raft held together by those few rare beautiful things that we know to be predictable ropes"}, {"start": 1029.58, "end": 1032.74, "text": "Fine fine. Let him finish us"}, {"start": 1034.18, "end": 1037.9, "text": "It won't matter what happens to us as long as we stay honest and accepting of each other's flaws and virtues"}, {"start": 1038.54, "end": 1042.22, "text": "Annie will always be driven surely will always be giving Pierce will never apologize"}, {"start": 1042.22, "end": 1046.5, "text": "Britt is sort of a wild card from my perspective and Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch"}, {"start": 1047.46, "end": 1049.46, "text": "There are six sides to this die and seven of us"}, {"start": 1049.9, "end": 1052.48, "text": "He devised a system by which he never has to get the pizza."}, {"start": 1052.48, "end": 1055.28, "text": "-Jack Willy! -He's a hefty jackraggler."}, {"start": 1055.28, "end": 1057.48, "text": "-Dag, man. -Pretty low, dude."}, {"start": 1057.48, "end": 1061.32, "text": "It's called friendship. Look it up and car to it."}, {"start": 1061.32, "end": 1063.58, "text": "I think we just found our pizza-getter."}, {"start": 1063.58, "end": 1065.32, "text": "-Yeah. -Yes, Jack will be dead."}, {"start": 1065.32, "end": 1067.82, "text": "-Good to know. -Oh, like it matters who goes."}, {"start": 1067.82, "end": 1069.62, "text": "[ Laughter ]"}, {"start": 1069.62, "end": 1073.3, "text": "-That's so funny. -Good karma."}, {"start": 1073.3, "end": 1076.1, "text": "That guy sucks harder than the toilet in an airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1076.1, "end": 1079.54, "text": "-Airplane bathroom. -Oh, my pipes."}, {"start": 1079.54, "end": 1082.54, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red lights ♪"}, {"start": 1082.54, "end": 1085.58, "text": "♪ Those days are all over ♪"}, {"start": 1085.58, "end": 1088.88, "text": "♪ You don't have to sell your money to the night ♪"}, {"start": 1088.88, "end": 1090.58, "text": "♪ Sing, girls, bro! ♪"}, {"start": 1090.58, "end": 1092.38, "text": "♪ You really love your plays ♪"}, {"start": 1092.38, "end": 1093.68, "text": "You should move here."}, {"start": 1093.68, "end": 1097.68, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1097.68, "end": 1100.18, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1100.18, "end": 1102.22, "text": "♪ You don't care if it's wrong ♪"}, {"start": 1102.22, "end": 1103.6, "text": "♪ Or if it's right ♪"}, {"start": 1103.6, "end": 1107.1, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red lights ♪"}, {"start": 1107.1, "end": 1109.4, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red lights ♪"}, {"start": 1109.4, "end": 1119.32, "text": "You guys see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1119.32, "end": 1123.32, "text": "♪ You're gonna have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1123.32, "end": 1124.26, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1124.26, "end": 1126.86, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1126.86, "end": 1127.7, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1127.7, "end": 1129.52, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1129.52, "end": 1130.36, "text": "- Don't try!"}, {"start": 1130.36, "end": 1131.2, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1131.2, "end": 1133.7, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1133.7, "end": 1134.54, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1134.54, "end": 1138.04, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1139.4, "end": 1142.74, "text": "- Two pierce, may he rest in pierce?"}, {"start": 1142.74, "end": 1144.58, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 1144.58, "end": 1146.78, "text": "- Shirley, don't you think you've had enough?"}, {"start": 1146.78, "end": 1147.62, "text": "- Of you?"}, {"start": 1147.62, "end": 1148.76, "text": "(gasps)"}, {"start": 1148.76, "end": 1150.6, "text": "Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.6, "end": 1151.96, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1151.96, "end": 1153.72, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.72, "end": 1156.72, "text": "Enough with the timeline crap, Abed."}, {"start": 1156.72, "end": 1159.12, "text": "Pierce got shot in the leg and died."}, {"start": 1159.12, "end": 1161.86, "text": "Shirley's a drunk, and he's locked in a mental ward"}, {"start": 1161.86, "end": 1164.04, "text": "because her guilt drove her insane."}, {"start": 1164.04, "end": 1166.16, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1166.16, "end": 1169.72, "text": "Troy lost his larynx because for some dumb reason"}, {"start": 1169.72, "end": 1172.88, "text": "he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1172.88, "end": 1175.8, "text": "Clearly you don't understand anything about the being a troll."}, {"start": 1175.8, "end": 1178.98, "text": "Life has gone to hell, Abed!"}, {"start": 1178.98, "end": 1180.28, "text": "This is real!"}, {"start": 1180.28, "end": 1181.96, "text": "Look at us, look at me!"}, {"start": 1181.96, "end": 1185.04, "text": "- Britta, you put one wash-away blue streak in your hair,"}, {"start": 1185.04, "end": 1187.0, "text": "and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1187.0, "end": 1189.16, "text": "- Exactly, life got dark."}, {"start": 1189.16, "end": 1190.36, "text": "- And I'll because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.36, "end": 1192.56, "text": "- Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.56, "end": 1193.52, "text": "- It's mine."}, {"start": 1193.52, "end": 1195.02, "text": "I've run through that night over and over in my head,"}, {"start": 1195.02, "end": 1196.5, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.5, "end": 1199.08, "text": "I should have caught the die and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1199.08, "end": 1201.24, "text": "I failed to do that and we all suffered for it,"}, {"start": 1201.24, "end": 1202.64, "text": "but I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 1205.04, "end": 1205.88, "text": "What is this?"}, {"start": 1205.88, "end": 1207.68, "text": "- Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest,"}, {"start": 1207.68, "end": 1209.68, "text": "which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.68, "end": 1211.14, "text": "I made us all black goatees out of felt."}, {"start": 1211.14, "end": 1211.98, "text": "I suggest you put them on"}, {"start": 1211.98, "end": 1213.48, "text": "until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1215.1, "end": 1217.34, "text": "From now on, I'm Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1217.34, "end": 1218.34, "text": "We are the evil study group"}, {"start": 1218.34, "end": 1220.46, "text": "and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1220.46, "end": 1222.24, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline,"}, {"start": 1222.24, "end": 1223.9, "text": "the one that I stopped you from rolling that die,"}, {"start": 1223.9, "end": 1225.38, "text": "then we destroy the good versions of ourselves"}, {"start": 1225.38, "end": 1226.88, "text": "and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1228.5, "end": 1230.9, "text": "- Evil Abed, as Evil Jeff,"}, {"start": 1230.9, "end": 1232.94, "text": "am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.94, "end": 1233.78, "text": "- Certainly."}, {"start": 1233.78, "end": 1234.94, "text": "- I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.94, "end": 1236.66, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.66, "end": 1241.1, "text": "I lost my damn arm and you're making fake beards!"}, {"start": 1241.1, "end": 1241.94, "text": "Go tease."}, {"start": 1248.44, "end": 1251.2, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1253.4, "end": 1254.6, "text": "- Evil Troy and Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1256.62, "end": 1259.36, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1262.12, "end": 1263.5, "text": "- Little pop it off biscuits."}, {"start": 1263.5, "end": 1265.66, "text": "What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1265.66, "end": 1266.56, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1266.56, "end": 1268.78, "text": "We got out just in space."}, {"start": 1268.78, "end": 1271.3, "text": "Well, I certainly walked right into that one, didn't I?"}, {"start": 1271.3, "end": 1273.22, "text": "I guess not then."}]}